text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', "All permanents are artifacts in addition to their other types.\\nAll cards that aren't on the battlefield, spells, and permanents are colorless.\\nPlayers may spend mana as though it were mana of any color.", 'Apocalypse Hydra enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it. If X is 5 or more, it enters the battlefield with an additional X +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{1}{R}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Apocalypse Hydra: It deals 1 damage to any target.', "As Nyxathid enters the battlefield, choose an opponent.\\nNyxathid gets -1/-1 for each card in the chosen player's hand.", 'As True-Name Nemesis enters the battlefield, choose a player.\\nTrue-Name Nemesis has protection from the chosen player.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\\nSearch your library for a card, put that card into your hand, then shuffle.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice an artifact or creature.\\nDraw cards equal to the mana value of the sacrificed permanent.', "Assist (Another player can pay up to {2} of this spell's cost.)\\nTwo target players each draw a card.", "Assist (Another player can pay up to {3} of this spell's cost.)\\nCounter target spell.", "Assist (Another player can pay up to {3} of this spell's cost.)\\nDestroy target creature with power 4 or greater.", "Assist (Another player can pay up to {3} of this spell's cost.)\\n{2}: Fan Favorite gets +1/+1 until end of turn. Any player may activate this ability.", "Assist (Another player can pay up to {4} of this spell's cost.)\\nFlying\\nWhen Skystreamer enters the battlefield, target player gains 4 life.", "Assist (Another player can pay up to {5} of this spell's cost.)\\nEach player shuffles their hand and graveyard into their library, then draws seven cards. Exile Game Plan.", "Assist (Another player can pay up to {5} of this spell's cost.)\\nWhen Bloodborn Scoundrels enters the battlefield, target opponent loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.", "Assist (Another player can pay up to {5} of this spell's cost.)\\nWhen Dwarven Lightsmith enters the battlefield, creatures your team controls get +1/+1 until end of turn.", "Assist (Another player can pay up to {6} of this spell's cost.)\\nExile all nonland permanents.", "Assist (Another player can pay up to {6} of this spell's cost.)\\nFlying\\nWhen Vampire Charmseeker enters the battlefield, return target instant, sorcery, or creature card from a graveyard to its owner's hand.", "Assist (Another player can pay up to {6} of this spell's cost.)\\nTrample, haste", "Assist (Another player can pay up to {6} of this spell's cost.)\\nWhen Spellweaver Duo enters the battlefield, you may return target tapped creature to its owner's hand.", "Assist (Another player can pay up to {7} of this spell's cost.)\\nFlying\\nWhen Lava-Field Overlord enters the battlefield, it deals 4 damage to target creature an opponent controls.", "Assist (Another player can pay up to {7} of this spell's cost.)\\nTrample", "Assist (Another player can pay up to {X} of this spell's cost. You choose the value of X.)\\nDestroy target creature with power X or less.", "Assist (Another player can pay up to {X} of this spell's cost. You choose the value of X.)\\nSupport X. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to X target creatures.)\\nEach creature with a +1/+1 counter on it gains trample until end of turn.", 'At the beginning of combat on your turn, you may discard a card. If you do, choose a creature. Whenever that creature deals combat damage to a player this turn, you draw two cards.', 'At the beginning of combat on your turn, you may have target creature get +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'At the beginning of combat on your turn, you may pay {3}{W}. If you do, support 2. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two other target creatures.)', 'At the beginning of each upkeep, Magmatic Force deals 3 damage to any target.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, exile the top card of each opponent's library. Until end of turn, you may cast spells from among those exiled cards, and you may spend mana as though it were mana of any color to cast those spells.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if an opponent controls more lands than you, you may search your library for up to three basic land cards, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Attacking creatures get +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Bathe in Dragonfire deals 4 damage to target creature.', 'Blaze deals X damage to any target.', 'Bountiful Promenade enters the battlefield tapped unless you have two or more opponents.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {W}.', "Chain Lightning deals 3 damage to any target. Then that player or that permanent's controller may pay {R}{R}. If the player does, they may copy this spell and may choose a new target for that copy.", "Charging Rhino can't be blocked by more than one creature.", 'Choose a creature at random, then destroy the rest.', "Choose three. You may choose the same mode more than once.\\n• Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.\\n• Return target creature to its owner's hand.\\n• Draw a card.", 'Counter target noncreature spell.', 'Counter target spell with mana value 2.', "Cowards can't block Warriors.\\n{R}: Target creature becomes a Coward until end of turn.\\n{2}{R}: Target creature becomes a Warrior until end of turn.", 'Create three 1/1 white Warrior creature tokens.', "Creatures with power less than Wandering Wolf's power can't block it.", 'Deathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', 'Defender, flying\\nPrevent all combat damage that would be dealt to and dealt by Fog Bank.', 'Defender\\nReach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)', 'Defender\\n{T}: Target creature gains haste until end of turn.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment. You gain 4 life.', 'Destroy target artifact, enchantment, or creature with flying.', 'Destroy target attacking creature.', 'Destroy target creature. Add {B}{B}{B}.', 'Destroy target creature. Its controller discards a card.', 'Destroy target permanent. Its controller creates a 3/3 green Beast creature token.', 'Destroy target tapped creature.', "Ember Beast can't attack or block alone.", "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has trample and lifelink. (Damage dealt by a creature with lifelink also causes its controller to gain that much life.)', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2, has flying, and is a Demon in addition to its other types.\\nWhen Inner Demon enters the battlefield, all non-Demon creatures get -2/-2 until end of turn.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+0 and has first strike. (It deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature has "{T}: Scry 1, then draw a card." (To scry 1, look at the top card of your library, then you may put that card on the bottom of your library.)', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature has double strike. (It deals both first-strike and regular combat damage.)', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature has haste.\\n{R}: Enchanted creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\nWhen a creature with mana value 6 or greater enters the battlefield, you may return Dragon Breath from your graveyard to the battlefield attached to that creature.', 'Enchant creature\\nWhen Angelic Gift enters the battlefield, draw a card.\\nEnchanted creature has flying.', "Enchant creature\\nWhen Claustrophobia enters the battlefield, tap enchanted creature.\\nEnchanted creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.", 'Enchant creature\\nWhen Karametra\'s Favor enters the battlefield, draw a card.\\nEnchanted creature has "{T}: Add one mana of any color."', 'Enchant land\\nWhenever enchanted land is tapped for mana, its controller adds an additional one mana of any color.', 'Exchange control of two target creatures.', "Exile target creature. At the beginning of the next end step, return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control with a +1/+1 counter on it.", 'Exile target creature. Its controller gains life equal to its power.', 'Feral Hydra enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{3}: Put a +1/+1 counter on Feral Hydra. Any player may activate this ability.', 'Fertilid enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{1}{G}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Fertilid: Target player searches their library for a basic land card, puts it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffles.', 'Flying', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", 'Flying, first strike', "Flying, vigilance, trample\\nAs Archon of Valor's Reach enters the battlefield, choose artifact, enchantment, instant, sorcery, or planeswalker.\\nPlayers can't cast spells of the chosen type.", 'Flying, vigilance\\nWhenever Jelenn Sphinx attacks, other attacking creatures get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying, vigilance\\n{1}{W}: Target creature with a +1/+1 counter on it gains flying and vigilance until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nLifelink (Damage dealt by this creature also causes you to gain that much life.)', "Flying\\nLoyal Pegasus can't attack or block alone.", 'Flying\\nSwarm of Bloodflies enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.\\nWhenever another creature dies, put a +1/+1 counter on Swarm of Bloodflies.', 'Flying\\nUrborg Drake attacks each combat if able.', 'Flying\\nWhen Expedition Raptor enters the battlefield, support 2. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two other target creatures.)', 'Flying\\nWhen Noxious Dragon dies, you may destroy target creature with mana value 3 or less.', 'Flying\\nWhen Peregrine Drake enters the battlefield, untap up to five lands.', 'Flying\\nWhen Screeching Buzzard dies, each opponent discards a card.', 'Flying\\nWhen Soaring Show-Off enters the battlefield, each player draws a card.', 'Flying\\nWhen Sower of Temptation enters the battlefield, gain control of target creature for as long as Sower of Temptation remains on the battlefield.', "Flying\\nWhenever Nimbus Champion attacks, you may return target creature to its owner's hand if that creature's power is less than or equal to the number of Warriors your team controls.", "Flying\\nWhenever Savage Ventmaw attacks, add {R}{R}{R}{G}{G}{G}. Until end of turn, you don't lose this mana as steps and phases end.", 'Flying\\nWhenever one or more +1/+1 counters are put on another creature you control, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Enduring Scalelord.', "Flying\\nWhenever you cast a spell, return target permanent to its owner's hand.", "Flying\\nYour opponents can't gain life.\\nAt the beginning of each end step, each opponent loses life equal to the life that player lost this turn. (Damage causes loss of life.)", 'Flying\\n{R}: Dragon Hatchling gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', "For each player, choose friend or foe. Each friend creates a token that's a copy of a creature they control. Each foe returns a creature they control to its owner's hand.", "For each player, choose friend or foe. Each friend discards all cards from their hand, then draws that many cards plus one. Khorvath's Fury deals damage to each foe equal to the number of cards in their hand.", 'For each player, choose friend or foe. Each friend puts a +1/+1 counter on each creature they control. Each foe chooses one untapped creature they control, then taps the rest.', 'For each player, choose friend or foe. Each friend returns a creature card from their graveyard to their hand. Each foe sacrifices a creature they control.', 'For each player, choose friend or foe. Each friend searches their library for a land card, puts it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffles. Each foe sacrifices an artifact or enchantment they control.', "Hexproof (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)", 'If an effect would create one or more tokens under your control, it creates twice that many of those tokens instead.\\nIf an effect would put one or more counters on a permanent you control, it puts twice that many of those counters on that permanent instead.', "Juggernaut attacks each combat if able.\\nJuggernaut can't be blocked by Walls.", "Kitesail Corsair has flying as long as it's attacking.", 'Kor Spiritdancer gets +2/+2 for each Aura attached to it.\\nWhenever you cast an Aura spell, you may draw a card.', 'Lifelink (Damage dealt by this creature also causes you to gain that much life.)', 'Lightwalker has flying as long as it has a +1/+1 counter on it.', 'Look at the top four cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'Luxury Suite enters the battlefield tapped unless you have two or more opponents.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {R}.', 'Morphic Pool enters the battlefield tapped unless you have two or more opponents.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}.', 'Night Market Guard can block an additional creature each combat.', 'Noosegraf Mob enters the battlefield with five +1/+1 counters on it.\\nWhenever a player casts a spell, remove a +1/+1 counter from Noosegraf Mob. If you do, create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', 'Other creatures have "Whenever this creature attacks, you may have it fight Grothama, All-Devouring."\\nWhen Grothama leaves the battlefield, each player draws cards equal to the amount of damage dealt to Grothama this turn by sources they controlled.', 'Partner with Blaring Captain (When this creature enters the battlefield, target player may put Blaring Captain into their hand from their library, then shuffle.)\\n{2}{W}: Create a 1/1 white Warrior creature token.', 'Partner with Blaring Recruiter (When this creature enters the battlefield, target player may put Blaring Recruiter into their hand from their library, then shuffle.)\\nWhenever Blaring Captain attacks, attacking Warriors get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Partner with Chakram Retriever (When this creature enters the battlefield, target player may put Chakram Retriever into their hand from their library, then shuffle.)\\n{R}, {T}: Chakram Slinger deals 2 damage to target player or planeswalker.', 'Partner with Chakram Slinger (When this creature enters the battlefield, target player may put Chakram Slinger into their hand from their library, then shuffle.)\\nWhenever you cast a spell during your turn, untap target creature.', 'Partner with Gorm the Great (When this creature enters the battlefield, target player may put Gorm into their hand from their library, then shuffle.)\\nDeathtouch\\nWhenever Virtus the Veiled deals combat damage to a player, that player loses half their life, rounded up.', 'Partner with Impetuous Protege (When this creature enters the battlefield, target player may put Impetuous Protege into their hand from their library, then shuffle.)\\n{W}, {T}: Tap target creature.', 'Partner with Khorvath Brightflame (When this creature enters the battlefield, target player may put Khorvath into their hand from their library, then shuffle.)\\nDouble strike\\nDragons your team controls have double strike.', 'Partner with Krav, the Unredeemed (When this creature enters the battlefield, target player may put Krav into their hand from their library, then shuffle.)\\nFlying\\nAt the beginning of each end step, if your team gained life this turn, create two 1/1 white Warrior creature tokens.', 'Partner with Ley Weaver (When this creature enters the battlefield, target player may put Ley Weaver into their hand from their library, then shuffle.)\\n{5}{U}{U}: Target player draws two cards.', 'Partner with Lore Weaver (When this creature enters the battlefield, target player may put Lore Weaver into their hand from their library, then shuffle.)\\n{T}: Untap two target lands.', 'Partner with Okaun, Eye of Chaos (When this creature enters the battlefield, target player may put Okaun into their hand from their library, then shuffle.)\\nAt the beginning of combat on your turn, flip a coin until you lose a flip.\\nWhenever a player wins a coin flip, draw a card.', 'Partner with Pir, Imaginative Rascal (When this creature enters the battlefield, target player may put Pir into their hand from their library, then shuffle.)\\nWhenever you draw a card, put a +1/+1 counter on Toothy, Imaginary Friend.\\nWhen Toothy leaves the battlefield, draw a card for each +1/+1 counter on it.', 'Partner with Proud Mentor (When this creature enters the battlefield, target player may put Proud Mentor into their hand from their library, then shuffle.)\\nWhenever Impetuous Protege attacks, it gets +X/+0 until end of turn, where X is the greatest power among tapped creatures your opponents control.', 'Partner with Regna, the Redeemer (When this creature enters the battlefield, target player may put Regna into their hand from their library, then shuffle.)\\n{B}, Sacrifice X creatures: Target player draws X cards and gains X life. Put X +1/+1 counters on Krav, the Unredeemed.', 'Partner with Soulblade Corrupter (When this creature enters the battlefield, target player may put Soulblade Corrupter into their hand from their library, then shuffle.)\\nWhen Soulblade Renewer enters the battlefield, support 2. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two other target creatures.)', 'Partner with Soulblade Renewer (When this creature enters the battlefield, target player may put Soulblade Renewer into their hand from their library, then shuffle.)\\nDeathtouch\\nWhenever a creature with a +1/+1 counter on it attacks one of your opponents, that creature gains deathtouch until end of turn.', 'Partner with Sylvia Brightspear (When this creature enters the battlefield, target player may put Sylvia into their hand from their library, then shuffle.)\\nFlying, haste\\nKnights your team controls have flying and haste.', 'Partner with Toothy, Imaginary Friend (When this creature enters the battlefield, target player may put Toothy into their hand from their library, then shuffle.)\\nIf one or more counters would be put on a permanent your team controls, that many plus one of each of those kinds of counters are put on that permanent instead.', 'Partner with Virtus the Veiled (When this creature enters the battlefield, target player may put Virtus into their hand from their library, then shuffle.)\\nVigilance\\nGorm the Great must be blocked if able, and Gorm must be blocked by two or more creatures if able.', "Partner with Zndrsplt, Eye of Wisdom (When this creature enters the battlefield, target player may put Zndrsplt into their hand from their library, then shuffle.)\\nAt the beginning of combat on your turn, flip a coin until you lose a flip.\\nWhenever a player wins a coin flip, double Okaun's power and toughness until end of turn.", "Phantom Warrior can't be blocked.", 'Put onto the battlefield under your control all creature cards in all graveyards that were put there from the battlefield this turn.', "Put target nonland permanent on top of its owner's library.", 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)', "Return target creature or land card from a graveyard to its owner's hand. You gain 6 life.", "Return target creature to its owner's hand. Gain control of all Auras and Equipment that were attached to it, then attach them to another creature.", "Return target creature to its owner's hand. Its controller draws a card.", "Sacrifice a creature: Draw cards equal to the sacrificed creature's power, then discard three cards.", 'Sea of Clouds enters the battlefield tapped unless you have two or more opponents.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {U}.', 'Search your library for up to two Forest cards, put them onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Shambling Ghoul enters the battlefield tapped.', 'Shock deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Spire Garden enters the battlefield tapped unless you have two or more opponents.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {G}.', 'Support 2. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two target creatures.)', 'Support 2. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two target creatures.)\\nDraw a card.', 'Target creature fights another target creature. (Each deals damage equal to its power to the other.)', 'Target creature gains haste until end of turn.\\nDraw a card.', 'Target creature gets +2/+0 and gains first strike until end of turn. (It deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)', 'Target creature gets +3/+1 and gains lifelink until end of turn. (Damage dealt by the creature also causes its controller to gain that much life.)', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +4/-4 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets -3/-3 until end of turn.', 'Target player discards two cards. Scry 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them on the bottom of your library and the rest on top in any order.)', 'Target player draws four cards.', 'Target player draws two cards and loses 2 life.', 'Target player gains 7 life and draws two cards.', 'The next time you would lose the game this turn, instead draw seven cards and your life total becomes 1.\\nExile Stunning Reversal.', "Trample\\nHexproof (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)", "Trample\\nIf damage would be dealt to another creature you control, prevent that damage. Put a +1/+1 counter on that creature for each 1 damage prevented this way.\\nWhen Vigor is put into a graveyard from anywhere, shuffle it into its owner's library.", 'Two target creatures your team controls each deal damage equal to their power to target creature.', "Untap Victory Chimes during each other player's untap step.\\n{T}: A player of your choice adds {C}.", "Untap all permanents you control during each other player's untap step.", 'Untap target creature. It gets +2/+2 and gains reach until end of turn. (It can block creatures with flying.)', 'Until end of turn, whenever a player casts an instant or sorcery spell, that player copies it and may choose new targets for the copy.', 'Up to two target creatures each get +1/+2 until end of turn. You gain 2 life.', 'Vigilance', 'Vigilance\\nWhen Riptide Crab dies, draw a card.', 'Warriors your team controls have haste.', 'When Arena Rector dies, you may exile it. If you do, search your library for a planeswalker card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'When Azra Bladeseeker enters the battlefield, each player on your team may discard a card, then each player who discarded a card this way draws a card.', 'When Centaur Healer enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life.', "When Dinrova Horror enters the battlefield, return target permanent to its owner's hand, then that player discards a card.", 'When Doomed Dissenter dies, create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', 'When Doomed Traveler dies, create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying.', 'When Eager Construct enters the battlefield, each player may scry 1. (To scry 1, look at the top card of your library, then you may put that card on the bottom of your library.)', 'When Elvish Visionary enters the battlefield, draw a card.', 'When Enthralling Victor enters the battlefield, gain control of target creature an opponent controls with power 2 or less until end of turn. Untap that creature. It gains haste until end of turn. (It can attack and {T} this turn.)', 'When Eyeblight Assassin enters the battlefield, target creature an opponent controls gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', "When Frost Lynx enters the battlefield, tap target creature an opponent controls. That creature doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.", "When Generous Patron enters the battlefield, support 2. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two other target creatures.)\\nWhenever you put one or more counters on a creature you don't control, draw a card.", 'When Hunted Wumpus enters the battlefield, each other player may put a creature card from their hand onto the battlefield.', 'When Jungle Wayfinder enters the battlefield, each player may search their library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into their hand, then shuffle.', 'When Omenspeaker enters the battlefield, scry 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them on the bottom of your library and the rest on top in any order.)', 'When Oreskos Explorer enters the battlefield, search your library for up to X Plains cards, where X is the number of players who control more lands than you. Reveal those cards, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', 'When Peace Strider enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life.', 'When Pierce Strider enters the battlefield, target opponent loses 3 life.', "When Rotfeaster Maggot enters the battlefield, exile target creature card from a graveyard. You gain life equal to that card's toughness.", 'When Saddleback Lagac enters the battlefield, support 2. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two other target creatures.)', 'When Slum Reaper enters the battlefield, each player sacrifices a creature.', 'When Sparring Mummy enters the battlefield, untap target creature.', 'When Spellseeker enters the battlefield, you may search your library for an instant or sorcery card with mana value 2 or less, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'When Stadium Vendors enters the battlefield, choose a player. That player adds two mana of any one color they choose.', "When Tenacious Dead dies, you may pay {1}{B}. If you do, return it to the battlefield tapped under its owner's control.", "When Together Forever enters the battlefield, support 2. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two target creatures.)\\n{1}: Choose target creature with a counter on it. When that creature dies this turn, return that card to its owner's hand.", 'When Veteran Explorer dies, each player may search their library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Whenever Aurora Champion attacks, if your team controls another Warrior, tap target creature.', 'Whenever Borderland Marauder attacks, it gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Bull-Rush Bruiser attacks, if your team controls another Warrior, Bull-Rush Bruiser gains first strike until end of turn.', 'Whenever Cheering Fanatic attacks, choose a card name. Spells with the chosen name cost {1} less to cast this turn.', 'Whenever Royal Trooper blocks, it gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Saltwater Stalwart deals damage to an opponent, target player draws a card.', 'Whenever Sickle Dancer attacks, if your team controls another Warrior, Sickle Dancer gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', "Whenever Thrasher Brute or another Warrior enters the battlefield under your team's control, target opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.", "Whenever a Warrior attacks, you may have its controller create a 1/1 white Warrior creature token that's tapped and attacking.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}: Untap all attacking creatures. They gain trample, lifelink, and haste until end of turn. After this phase, there is an additional combat phase. Activate only during combat.", 'Whenever a creature dies, you may put a quest counter on Quest for the Gravelord.\\nRemove three quest counters from Quest for the Gravelord and sacrifice it: Create a 5/5 black Zombie Giant creature token.', 'Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, you gain life equal to its toughness.', "Whenever a nontoken creature enters the battlefield, if Genesis Chamber is untapped, that creature's controller creates a 1/1 colorless Myr artifact creature token.", 'Whenever an instant or sorcery spell is cast during your turn, Sentinel Tower deals damage to any target equal to 1 plus the number of instant and sorcery spells cast before that spell this turn.', 'Whenever an opponent draws a card, you may pay {1}. If you do, draw a card.', 'Whenever an opponent taps a land for mana, tap all lands that player controls.\\nIf a creature an opponent controls attacks, all creatures that opponent controls attack if able.', "Whenever another Warrior enters the battlefield under your team's control, put a +1/+1 counter on Decorated Champion.", 'Whenever another creature enters the battlefield, untap Midnight Guard.', "Whenever another nontoken creature enters the battlefield, you may pay {1}{G}. If you do, that creature's controller creates a token that's a copy of that creature.", 'Whenever you tap a Swamp for mana, add an additional {B}.\\n{B}: Nirkana Revenant gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Whenever your opponents are dealt combat damage, if any of that damage was dealt by a Warrior, you draw a card and you lose 1 life.', "Wrap in Flames deals 1 damage to each of up to three target creatures. Those creatures can't block this turn.", 'You may have Evil Twin enter the battlefield as a copy of any creature on the battlefield, except it has "{U}{B}, {T}: Destroy target creature with the same name as this creature."', '[+2]: During target player\'s next turn, each creature that player controls attacks if able.\\n[−2]: Rowan Kenrith deals 3 damage to each tapped creature target player controls.\\n[−8]: Target player gets an emblem with "Whenever you activate an ability that isn\'t a mana ability, copy it. You may choose new targets for the copy."\\nPartner with Will Kenrith\\nRowan Kenrith can be your commander.', '[+2]: Until your next turn, up to two target creatures each have base power and toughness 0/3 and lose all abilities.\\n[−2]: Target player draws two cards. Until your next turn, instant, sorcery, and planeswalker spells that player casts cost {2} less to cast.\\n[−8]: Target player gets an emblem with "Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, copy it. You may choose new targets for the copy."\\nPartner with Rowan Kenrith\\nWill Kenrith can be your commander.', '{1}{R}, Sacrifice a land: Put a +1/+1 counter on Goblin Razerunners.\\nAt the beginning of your end step, you may have Goblin Razerunners deal damage equal to the number of +1/+1 counters on it to target player or planeswalker.', '{1}{R}{G}: Relentless Hunter gets +1/+1 and gains trample until end of turn.', '{1}{W}, Sacrifice Silverchase Fox: Exile target enchantment.', "{2}{U}, {T}: Target player draws a card, then exiles a card from their hand. If a creature card is exiled this way, that player creates a token that's a copy of that card.\\nWhen Arcane Artisan leaves the battlefield, exile all tokens created with it at the beginning of the next end step.", '{4}, {T}: Tap target creature.', "{4}{U}: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.", '{5}{G}: Kraul Warrior gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', '{7}{R}: Flamewave Invoker deals 5 damage to target player or planeswalker.', '{R}, Sacrifice Reckless Reveler: Destroy target artifact.', '{T}, Pay 3 life: Flip a coin. If you win the flip, you gain 6 life.', '{T}, Sacrifice a creature: Put a charge counter on Culling Dais.\\n{1}, Sacrifice Culling Dais: Draw a card for each charge counter on Culling Dais.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.)', '{T}: Choose a player. That player adds one mana of any color they choose.', '{T}: Exile Mangara of Corondor and target permanent.', "{T}: Target creature with power 2 or less can't be blocked this turn.", '{T}: Target player draws a card, then discards a card.', '{U}: Watercourser gets +1/-1 until end of turn.', "{W}: Brightling gains vigilance until end of turn.\\n{W}: Brightling gains lifelink until end of turn.\\n{W}: Return Brightling to its owner's hand.\\n{1}: Brightling gets +1/-1 or -1/+1 until end of turn.", "{W}{U}, {T}: Put a bribery counter on target creature you don't control. Its controller draws a card.\\nCreatures with bribery counters on them can't attack or block.", '{X}, {T}: Untap X target lands.']
flavor: ['"A good lagac will carry you through thick and thin. A bad one ... well, it\'s a tasty dinner."\\n—Raff Slugeater, goblin shortcutter', '"A shrill creature that delights in the misery of others—what\'s not to love?"\\n—Braids, dementia summoner', '"A slayer gets by on wits and reflexes."\\n—Higa, slayer-captain of Gatstaf', '"Always a welcome sight breaking through the clouds."\\n—Talrand, sky summoner', '"Are you sure this is going to work?" asked Will. "No," said Rowan. "But if it does, it\'s going to be spectacular."', '"As the experimental population grows, so do the number of myr. It\'s a perfect equilibrium."\\n—Memnarch', '"Be careful in your hunt. The clever little creature can steal your wards and lead you right into the werewolf\'s den."\\n—Britta, midwife of Gatstaf', '"Beware an eddy where there should be none or a stretch that flows too fast or too slow."\\n—Old Fishbones, Martyne river guide', '"Big, wicked, and not too smart. Poor thing never stood a chance against us, dear."\\n—Regna, to Krav', '"Boggart blood disgusts me almost as much as the foul creatures themselves."', '"Do you hear that, Sarkhan? The glory of the horde! I made a legend from what you abandoned."\\n—Zurgo, khan of the Mardu', '"Dragons are feared for their breath and their bite, but it is their wings that make them unconquerable. Bring them to earth, and they die like any other beast."\\n—Kassur, Sultai hunter', '"Even if I should die in the saddle, she will not let me fall to the ground."\\n—Hypatia of the Winged Horse', '"Every creation carries a piece of its creators. Their knowledge, their dreams, their soul. That is the best part."', '"Everyone has a price."', '"Finally, a weapon the Boros can\'t confiscate!"\\n—Juri, proprietor of the Juri Revue', '"Forswear the flesh and you will truly see."\\n—Jin-Gitaxias, Core Augur', '"From a tiny sprout, the greatest trees grow and flourish. May the seeds of your mind be equally fruitful."', '"Get ready, son."', '"Her voice is the wilderness, savage and pure."\\n—Kamahl, druid acolyte', '"I have been brought to this place and I cannot leave. I may be free of the amber, but I am still in prison."', '"I lead, destruction follows."', '"I like a quick victory. More time to celebrate."', '"I never give odds on my own fights. Unless, of course, you want to bet *against* me . . ."', '"I run, and thunder follows."', '"I see something special in you—a bright ember that yearns to dance among the stars."', '"I swore to take one head for each member of my family they killed. My task is nowhere near its end."', '"I will build no sanctuaries. The safety you seek can be won only by the sword."\\n—Yannash, outpost builder', '"Ideas drift like petals on the wind. I have only to lift my face to the breeze."', '"In this new world, I have seen the once-devout rhoxes take up arms with the savages of Jund. I would be offended, but I see the wisdom in their choice."\\n—Gernan, Dawnray archer', '"It is fascinating to see how the people of this plane replicate magical techniques without a natural gift. Also frustrating."\\n—Jace Beleren', '"It might fight the Eldrazi, but don\'t mistake it for a companion, Gideon. It\'s not interested in your concept of strength through unity."\\n—Najiya, leader of the Tajuru', '"Little flower twirl and bloom, arise from this your rocky tomb. Little warrior slash and brawl, be born again to free us all."', '"Loyalty guides me. Pride compels me. Anger sustains me. And the pay isn\'t bad."', '"Many scales make the skin of a dragon."\\n—Abzan wisdom', '"Monsters dwell in every heart. We only think civilization tames them." ―Euphemia, Nexus watcher', '"Never get too attached to a weapon. You must allow a better one to find its way to you."', '"No one chooses to be stitched together into a skaab. If it could speak, it would beg for its own destruction."\\n—Thalia, Knight-Cathar', '"Now everyone knows what you are."', '"One head watches for Consulate enforcers. The other watches for renegade thieves."\\n—Crime Lord Gonti', '"Opportunity isn\'t something you wait for. It\'s something you create."', '"Our pyromancer\'s flames may not have killed them, but they bought us the time we needed."\\n—*The War Diaries*', '"Pain isn\'t a negative stimulus. Pain is a sign of your imperfection."\\n—Sheoldred, Whispering One', '"Pathetic! I\'ve heard more noise in a monastery. Let me hear you, Valor\'s Reach!"', '"Petrifying gaze, deadly fangs, knifelike dorsal spines, venomous saliva . . . Am I missing anything? . . . Toxic bones? Seriously?"\\n—Samila, Murasa Expeditionary House', '"Potions! Mana potions, health potions, energy potions—get your potions here!"', '"Punch \'em, kick \'em, bite \'em, beat \'em! Burn \'em all and we\'ll defeat \'em!"', '"Sea Gate may have fallen, but we still stand. We still fight."\\n—Gideon Jura', '"She knows every step of this coastline, both above and below the surface, and she has hideouts all along the way. She will get you there."\\n—Jori En, expedition leader', '"Show them the light, my love."\\n—Krav, the Unredeemed', '"Some fates you can see coming for you, plain as day, and there\'s nothing you can do about them."\\n—Callaphe the mariner', '"The Vanished must have sent it from beyond to aid us in this struggle."\\n—Kessla, Sylvok shaman', '"The blood of Dromoka and the blood of my veins are the same."', '"The construction of a defense is not accomplished by adding bricks."\\n—Jace Beleren', '"The expected way through the trial is far too tedious."', '"The gods of Theros are born of the expectations and beliefs of mortals. If I have found godhood, what does that say about their true desires?"\\n—Xenagos, god of revels', '"The greatest gift Dromoka gives is the ability to fly without wings."\\n—Urdnan, Dromoka warrior', '"The prohibition of unnecessary tossing of the citizenry by giants shall also extend to spontaneous giants."\\n—Isperia\'s Edict, provision VII.789.2', '"The union of sea and sky makes a perfect cover."\\n—Talrand, sky summoner', '"The victim was either clawed to death or struck by lightning. Possibly both."\\n—Pel Javya, Wojek investigator', '"There is elegance in all the Ojutai do—even their killing."\\n—Kirada, Silumgar enforcer', '"There will be no secrets between us... like it or not."', '"There\'s wisdom to be gained in death—whether it be one\'s own or someone else\'s."\\n—Jarad, Golgari Lich-Lord', '"This is how wars are won—not with armies of soldiers but with a single knife blade, artfully placed."\\n—Yurin, royal assassin', '"Those dragons grow fast. For a while they feed on squirrels and goblins and then suddenly you\'re missing a mammoth."\\n—Hurdek, Mazar mammoth trainer', '"Though tempered differently, all wills can be broken."\\n—Inquisitor Kyrik', '"To the unskilled, it appears as blurred patches of distorted light. Few have seen its true form."\\n—Garruk Wildspeaker', '"Use everything. Iron, rust, scrap . . . even the ground must join our cause."\\n—Ezuri, renegade leader', '"Welcome to the Dimir Public Offices. Not responsible for death or loss of property. Basement off-limits."\\n—Sign outside Dinrova Building', '"Welcome to the winning team."', '"Well, who do we have here, Gorm?"\\n"No one, Virtus. No one at all."', '"What would Urza think, I wonder, if he could hear how the nature mages still snarl at his name, but venerate the work of his apprentice?"\\n—Teferi, to Jhoira', '"When you\'re on watch, no noise is harmless and no shadow can be ignored."\\n—Olgard of the Skiltfolk', '"Why perch in the crow\'s nest when I can fly like the crows?"', '"Within this grove, you belong to me."', '"You call it luck. I call it preparation."', '"You harbor such vast potential. It would be such a shame to let you die of old age."\\n—Zul Ashur, lich lord', '"You will be reimbursed for your donation."\\n"The reimbursement is spiritual."\\n—Temple signs', '"You wish to remember this lesson? I will write it down for you."\\n—Senifet, vizier of Bontu', '"You\'ve got to keep your wits about you on the roofs. Not all stones are compliant handholds."\\n—Iveta, rooftop runner', 'A light to bring hope in dark times.', 'A moment of distraction, a lifetime of regret.', 'A raptor will follow any order as long as that order is "hunt," "kill," or "go for the guts."', 'A spike and a maul are needed to crack their shells, but the taste is worth the effort.', 'All skyships entering or leaving the fairgrounds must pass through the security checkpoint.', 'Ancient magic reshapes the stage into a variety of landscapes.', 'Arena beasts are bred for flashiness and foul temper. An extra head addresses both requirements.', 'Aspiring to earn their place in the afterlife, acolytes train every day against those who fell short of that glory.', 'Bitter vengeance never glowed so bright nor sang so sweet.', 'Blessed by the gods. Coveted by mortals. Beholden to neither.', 'Born of volcanic forces, it thrives on the absolute panic it inspires.', 'Brutality had never been so exquisite.', "Consulate guards who pursue fleeing renegades into the Cowl often become lost—occasionally permanently—in the city's wildest greenbelt.", "Dragons of Silumgar's brood begin to digest their prey even before consuming it, letting their caustic breath do much of the work.", 'Earth elementals have the eternal strength of stone and the endurance of mountains. Primordially connected to the land they inhabit, they take a long-term view of things, scorning the impetuous haste of short-lived mortal creatures.', 'Every attack is a test of your defenses. Every hit marks the map of your defeat.', 'Fblthp had always hated crowds.', 'Few among the Azorius have ever spoken with the sphinxes, but all have felt their influence.', 'Finding an unexplored world, they immediately set it on fire.', 'Fire never dies alone.', 'For the first time in his life, Grakk felt a little warm and fuzzy inside.', "From thrilling combat to unparalleled vistas, Valor's Reach has it all.", 'Gideon and Nissa carved a path through the Eldrazi swarm, and their Zendikari allies charged into the fray behind them.', 'Hate is an everlasting wellspring from which it is eternally sustained.', "He vowed he would never rest until he reached his destination. He doesn't know how right he was.", 'Her prophecies amaze her even as she speaks them.', 'Humans still feared wolves, though no connection between them and the curse of lycanthropy had ever been proved.', "If you stare at the sun for too long, you'll lose your ability to see clearly.", 'In the Gudul delta, bloodfly bites are indistinguishable from spear wounds.', 'In times of infestation and war, Zendikar favors the blades that strike in unison.', 'Inside even the humblest goblin lurks the potential for far greater things—and far worse.', 'Instructors at the Kasarna training grounds are capable healers in case their students fail to grasp the subtleties of combat.', 'Is it at the top of the food chain or the bottom?', 'It glides over the landscape. It also happens to be one.', 'It keeps the upper reaches of the forest free of every menace . . . except for the spider itself.', 'It readily attacks much larger prey, knowing retaliation is impossible.', 'It shreds its prey as each head fights for the choicest bits.', 'It sleeps with its claws open.', "It's rare that the Prakhata Club closes its doors. It's also rare that Lord Gonti meets with Consul Kambal. What are the odds the two would occur on the same day?", "It's sent into unguilded districts by the Orzhov to collect the souls of those no one will miss.", "It's the pinnacle of utter destructiveness.", 'Just one can feed a dozen people for a month.', 'Lightning reflexes, thunderous might.', "Loyal to a fault, it anticipates its master's every need.", "Mages and warriors recruited from across Kylem display their skills at Valor's Reach.", 'Many a besieged city has surrendered upon hearing the distinctive rumble of the juggernaut.', "Many combatants at Valor's Reach wield glowing weapons to distract their enemies and delight the crowd.", "No pilgrimage to Valor's Reach is complete without a stroll through its celebrated shopping district.", 'On Bant, a sigil is both a prize of honor and a bond of duty. The one who bears it may be called to fulfill that charge at any moment.', "Once a year, Akrasa holds a joust that draws knights and their leotaus from every nation on Bant. The prize is an Akrasan sigil, but the true reward is the angel's kiss.", 'Once he gets up and going, he will forever shamble on.', 'One glamer leads him far from home. The next washes away his memory that home was ever anywhere but at her side.', 'One of the many reasons why open-air markets close at dusk.', "Only the sun that beats down upon Arashin's walls could shine more brightly.", 'Plan for victory, or prepare for defeat.', 'Poets dream the verses of otherworldly stories. Artificers dream the blueprints of otherplanar artifacts.', 'Progress comes at a price.', 'Raising the bones of Hekjek the Mad proved far easier than getting them to lie back down.', 'Rakdos cultists are her best customers. They never flinch at pain and are seldom good at math.', 'Razia, archangel of war, demands total commitment.', 'Relentless as the sea, remorseless as death.', 'Say hello to your new friend.', "She is adept at navigating the stadium's ever-changing landscape.", 'She reaches beyond the physical realm, touching the ideals from which all creatures draw their power.', 'Silumgar trains those whom he favors in his magic, granting them the ability to spread his disdain across the land.', 'Six feet of earth muffled his cries.', "Skybridges from across Kylem converge at the grand stadium of Valor's Reach.", 'Some competitors fight for glory or money. Some just like hitting people.', 'Some spectators love an underdog, but others are just as happy to support a proven winner.', 'Some train all their lives for a shot at the title. Some just get really, really lucky.', "Success at Valor's Reach requires not only individual skill but also the ability to merge that skill with a partner's.", 'Succession is a matter of blood, and by blood it is often decided.', 'Synchronized spell weaving is a difficult but rewarding skill to master.', "Takedowns in Valor's Reach are never meant to be lethal, but that doesn't mean they won't be incredibly painful.", 'The built-in obstacles force competitors to think three moves ahead.', 'The competition is but one aspect of the spectacle.', 'The favored noisemaker of goblins ever since the wardens cracked down on explosives.', 'The first searchlights were given as gifts, symbols of cooperation, to the emissaries present at the signing of the Guildpact.', "The forest's constant struggle is to keep the spreading flowstone at bay.", 'The harmony of the glorious is a dirge to the wicked.', "The harvest god's cornucopia contains the fruits of the fields, the forest, and beyond.", 'The insectile kraul lurk in the tunnels below street level. Many are loyal to the Golgari Swarm, but others follow their own esoteric caste system.', 'The knights of Troinir Keep took the rhino as their emblem due to its intense focus when charging down a perceived threat—a trait they discovered on a hunting excursion.', "The line between victory and defeat can be as slim as a razor's edge.", 'The most sensational plays send everyone home breathless.', 'The oddsmakers hate him because every fight is a foregone conclusion. The crowd loves him for exactly the same reason.', 'The only livestock that will survive for long in the Smelting District, ember beasts serve many functions—none of them willingly.', 'The people of the Sevick Isles have a unique understanding of the term "ominous clouds."', 'The person who finishes a journey is rarely the same as the one who starts it.', 'The ring plays host to some combatants that the spectators love to hate.', 'The scent of cooked flesh lingers in the charred landscape of Tarkir.', "The sculptor, like most artists, put his heart and soul into his work. But the newly awakened golem decided it wanted its creator's other, more tangible parts.", 'The shaman rattles not to inspire a battle fury but to drown out the shrieks of those fleeing the Eldrazi.', 'The smallest seed of regret can bloom into redemption.', 'The stadium is well-stocked with hazards to force the action if combatants show too much caution.', 'The stadium tests more than just fighting skill. For example, swimming ability.', 'The tools of invention became the weapons of revolution.', 'The true strength of nature is not the raging storm or the charging rhino, but the inexorable vitality of life.', 'The view is rivaled only by the decadence of the decor.', 'The wardens watch for illegal tactics and protect spectators from the occasional rogue fireball.', "There is only one fate left to those banished from the God-Pharaoh's city.", "There will always be a spot at Valor's Reach for headlong violence.", 'Though she is rightly feared, there are relatively few tales of her deeds in battle, for few survive her raids.', "Victories at Valor's Reach are broadcast via griffins in the sky above.", 'When Selesnya missionaries moved into the Shanav Quarter, they faced scorn, ridicule, and ultimately martyrdom.', 'When the twin-spell bonus round begins, the crowd rises to its feet in anticipation of incredible combinations.', 'With practice, the measurement of magic can lead to its mastery.', "You can always tell the evil one by the dagger he's sticking in you.", 'Zndrsplt retired from officiating when she teamed up with Okaun, but she still knows the penalties better than anyone else.']
artist: ['Aaron Miller', 'Adam Rex', 'Adrian Majkrzak', 'Alex Horley-Orlandelli', 'Alex Konstad', 'Allen Williams', 'Anastasia Ovchinnikova', 'Anna Steinbauer', 'Anthony Palumbo', 'Anthony S. Waters', 'Bayard Wu', 'Carmen Sinek', 'Chase Stone', 'Chris Rahn', 'Chris Rallis', 'Chris Seaman', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Christopher Rush', 'Chuck Lukacs', 'Cliff Childs', 'Clint Cearley', 'Craig J Spearing', 'Cynthia Sheppard', 'D. Alexander Gregory', 'Dallas Williams', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Dana Knutson', 'Darek Zabrocki', 'Daren Bader', 'Dave Dorman', 'David Gaillet', 'David Martin', 'David Palumbo', 'David Rapoza', 'Dmitry Burmak', 'Esad Ribic', 'Filip Burburan', 'Florian de Gesincourt', 'Gabor Szikszai', 'Greg Opalinski', 'Greg Staples', 'Grzegorz Rutkowski', 'Heather Hudson', 'Hideaki Takamura', 'Howard Lyon', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Izzy', 'Jack Wang', 'Jaime Jones', 'Jakub Kasper', 'Jama Jurabaev', 'James Zapata', 'Jason A. Engle', 'Jason Chan', 'Jason Felix', 'Jason Kang', 'Jason Rainville', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'Jim Murray', 'Joe Slucher', 'Johann Bodin', 'Johannes Voss', 'John Avon', 'John Severin Brassell', 'John Stanko', 'Jonas De Ro', 'Joseph Meehan', 'Josh Hass', 'Josu Hernaiz', 'Jung Park', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Kev Walker', 'Kieran Yanner', 'Lake Hurwitz', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Lius Lasahido', 'Livia Prima', 'Luca Zontini', 'Lucas Graciano', 'Magali Villeneuve', 'Manuel Castañón', 'Marco Nelor', 'Mark Behm', 'Mark Romanoski', 'Mark Tedin', 'Mark Winters', 'Mark Zug', 'Martina Pilcerova', 'Mathias Kollros', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Matt Stewart', 'Mike Bierek', 'Mike Burns', 'Mike Sass', 'Mitchell Malloy', 'Naomi Baker', 'Noah Bradley', 'Randy Gallegos', 'Randy Vargas', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Richard Wright', 'Robert Bliss', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Sam Burley', 'Sam Rowan', 'Sam Wood', 'Sara Winters', 'Scott Chou', 'Scott M. Fischer', 'Seb McKinnon', 'Sidharth Chaturvedi', 'Slawomir Maniak', 'Steve Argyle', 'Steve Prescott', 'Steven Belledin', 'Suzanne Helmigh', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Terese Nielsen', 'Thomas M. Baxa', 'Titus Lunter', 'Todd Lockwood', 'Tomasz Jedruszek', 'Tommy Arnold', 'Tony Foti', 'Uriah Voth', 'Viktor Titov', 'Véronique Meignaud', 'Warren Mahy', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Wesley Burt', 'Winona Nelson', 'Yeong-Hao Han', 'Yongjae Choi', 'Zack Stella', 'Zoltan Boros', 'Zoltan Boros & Gabor Szikszai', 'rk post']
